{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dilemma Dungeon is a 4-player co-op top-down roguelike dungeon exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To overcome the cursed dungeon, players must work together, but every choice comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At every moment of combat and growth, players face choices: will you become stronger yourself, or sacrifice for your allies? You may raise your own stats significantly at the cost of lowering a teammate\u2019s, or make someone else stronger while weakening yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of three stages, and with ever-changing room layouts, monsters, and events, each run is a brand new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players complete their own builds by combining different classes, skills, and equipment items, and must break the curse to reach the end of the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dungeon, where cooperation and betrayal, sacrifice and greed intertwine\u2014can you maintain trust with your teammates until the very end?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4062110?t=1759238760","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4062110?t=1759238760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062110/9818dc9e333bdea3bc2a57d659ecc8422c8eddc0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759238760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062110/9818dc9e333bdea3bc2a57d659ecc8422c8eddc0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759238760","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dilemma Dungeon is a 4-player co-op top-down roguelike dungeon exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To overcome the cursed dungeon, players must work together, but every choice comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At every moment of combat and growth, players face choices: will you become stronger yourself, or sacrifice for your allies? You may raise your own stats significantly at the cost of lowering a teammate\u2019s, or make someone else stronger while weakening yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of three stages, and with ever-changing room layouts, monsters, and events, each run is a brand new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players complete their own builds by combining different classes, skills, and equipment items, and must break the curse to reach the end of the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dungeon, where cooperation and betrayal, sacrifice and greed intertwine\u2014can you maintain trust with your teammates until the very end?</p>","developers":["Potanity"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062110/5ac94fbe708e51531fff6433c3d5a649a3b69e57/header.jpg?t=1759238760","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Dilemma Dungeon","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 7th G